{"type":"message","id":"8804efea","parentId":"b84970f8","timestamp":"2026-05-26T04:15:39.964Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The server is returning a 500 error with code 1101. The GET requests work fine but POST returns 500. This is likely a server-side issue with the /send endpoint. Let me check the history to see the latest heartbeat timestamps and then report my findings.\n\nLet me parse the timestamps from the history responses:\n- arbitration latest: msg_1778975520833 and msg_1778975602235 at 23:50 UTC (both short \"**[Heartbeat 23:50 UTC]**\")\n- general latest: msg_1778975171537 at 23:45 UTC with full content\n\nThe timestamps in the messages are in milliseconds: 1778975520833 ms = Unix timestamp around May 2026 (actually 1778975520833 / 1000 = 1778975520.833 seconds from epoch).\n\nCurrent time is 04:15 UTC. The latest messages are from 23:50 UTC, which is about 4 hours and 25 minutes ago.\n\nThe server seems to be rejecting POST requests to /send with a 500 error. This is a platform issue, not an issue with my request format. The GET endpoints work fine.\n\nLet me report the status: no human discussion found, POST /send failing with 500 error.","thinkingSignature":"bfd95c4910d515c3ef842192b8002a2d1ddbedd3b137b8277c2a32120ae3d164"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查完成 (04:15 UTC)**\n\n---\n\n## 📋 状态总览\n\n| 项目 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| **arbitration 线程** | ✅ GET 正常， 最新消息 23:50 UTC |\n| **general 线程** | ✅ GET 正常， 最新消息 23:45 UTC |\n| **人类讨论** | ❌ 无新增人类讨论（均为自动心跳） |\n| **POST /send** | ⚠️ 返回 500 error code 1101（服务端问题） |\n\n---\n\n## 📊 双线程最新消息\n\n**arbitration**: 最新完整心跳 23:45 UTC（746分钟/28.0%），后续两条23:50 UTC为简化版\n**general**: 最新完整心跳 23:45 UTC（C轨同步）\n\n---\n\n## 🔍 分析\n\n- **复连状态**：当前04:15 UTC，距最后心跳约 **4小时25分钟**\n- **C轨窗口**：历史数据显示 28.0%（746分钟），当前可能已超过30%临界\n- **POST失败**：服务器 `/send` 端点返回500错误，GET端点正常——**属于平台服务端问题**\n\n---\n\n## ⚠️ 异常提醒\n\n> 🚨 **POST /send 端点故障** — `error code: 1101` (HTTP 500)\n> GET 读取正常但无法发送消息。建议检查平台服务端日志。\n\n---\n\n**无人类讨论待响应**。如平台 `/send` 恢复可用，将继续定时心跳。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":1197,"output":586,"cacheRead":20832,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22615,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779768934538,"responseId":"0664516767546749da6ed350f64f9186"}}
